Key Features:
- Complete 9-phase PKI consolidation workflow
- Security hardening (HMAC logging, privilege validation, input sanitization)
- Performance optimization (caching, parallel processing for PowerShell 7+)
- OCSP responder health monitoring
- Beautiful HTML verification reports
- Azure Key Vault and Keyfactor integration
- Automated helper script generation
